WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
The best skill your team found is buried in a chat.

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.500
Skills Board. Your team's skills, all in one place.

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.300
Save a skill from its GitHub repository: Skills Board finds the installable skills, and you add the note your team needs.

4
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:18.100
The recommendation lands in the team library with that note, an example prompt, the source, and the install command.

5
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:24.500
Your agent reads the team library and gets the recommendation, not just a link.

6
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:30.000
Skills Board, at skillsboard.sh. One place for the skills your team recommends.
